  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien roots reggae with a one-drop groove. Offbeat skank guitar chopped on the and-beats; bubbling Hammond organ; deep, round bass guitar carrying a melodic line; one-drop drums with rimshot and the kick on beat three; melodica answering the vocal. Warm analogue roots mix, spring-reverb and tape-echo dub throws on the snare in the break. Easygoing male tenor with a loose call-and-response neighbourhood chorus. 76 BPM, G major. Sunny, splashy and loose. No dancehall digital riddim, no trap, no autotune, no EDM, no ska upstroke rush.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n禮拜透早 日頭赤炎炎\n阿叔 拖出伊彼條水管\n伊講 今仔日欲洗車\n規條巷仔 攏聽著伊咧喝\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n泡仔噴甲 規台白泡泡\n囡仔 攏走出來 看鬧熱\n\n[Chorus]\n水沖落來 涼涼涼\n車洗清氣 人嘛澹漉漉\n阿叔 你毋通 對遮沖\n啊 已經 來毋赴矣\n\n[Verse]\n阿姨 捾一跤水桶 行出來\n隔壁少年 提水槍來相戰\n阿叔 跳過機車的後座\n拖鞋 噴上 對面的厝頂\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n狗仔 嘛走來 鬥鬧熱\n咬著水管 毋放 咧搖尾\n\n[Chorus]\n水沖落來 涼涼涼\n衫褲澹甲 會當絞水\n阿姨 你毋通 對遮沖\n啊 已經 來毋赴矣\n\n[Bridge]\n車洗好矣 閣去曝日\n阮坐佇亭仔跤 食枝仔冰\n\n[Chorus]\n水沖落來 涼涼涼\n天頂一下烏 雨煞落來\n阿叔 車又閣 澹去矣\n伊笑講 按呢 免閣洗\n\n[Outro]\n下禮拜 閣來洗一擺",
